*                                                                          *
*   Description   : Target: Main 2025-07-16 Ragexe. Consume 197-byte       *
*                   0x09DA rows; widen native rows116->220, preserving     *
*                   the sole owned item-title string through               *
*                   copy/move/growth. Relocate parser records and unwind   *
*                   locals, update all three native tabs. The server does  *
*                   not emit CItem-backed0x0B3E; that unused variant is    *
*                   gated. Native hooks, data and code revert together     *
*                   with the selecting patch.                              *
*                                                                          *
